    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST TODAY!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/e1fc473d95deccf96cab560cb9a23803.avif?t=1677256883\" /></div><br><br><strong>LineHold</strong> online CO-OP Twin Stick Shooter mixed with Tower Defense. Survive as long as you can and expand your base as much as you can before next waves comes. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/c6ccd230694aa82c5c09e66ee167c6d7.poster.avif?t=1677256883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/c6ccd230694aa82c5c09e66ee167c6d7.webm?t=1677256883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/c6ccd230694aa82c5c09e66ee167c6d7.mp4?t=1677256883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tower Defense + Base Building</h2>Create your base filled with different turrets and buildings such as cloning unit, radar and many others. Additionally use indestructible nodes that you can use to build intricate maze for your enemies and block off strategic paths. Your planning and foresight will help you live longer.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/8adba68d95e5164ba866230388b23372.poster.avif?t=1677256883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/8adba68d95e5164ba866230388b23372.webm?t=1677256883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/8adba68d95e5164ba866230388b23372.mp4?t=1677256883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character Progression</h2>Choose your speciality and adjust unlocked skills to your gameplay! You decide what your character will be better at by choosing new skills and perks. And with each level you unlock more weapons and structures.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/c86bc79c859772af785dd12853bd1fbb.avif?t=1677256883\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vast Arsenal</h2> Fight waves of enemies swarming your base using 10 different weapons - each of them has two firing modes. Use them to create combo effects for maximum damage. Keep shooting as your second weapon is reloading in the meantime - NON STOP ACTION!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Campaign Mode and Survival Mode</h2>Progress through more and more challenging missions in campaign or try to survive as long as possible in survival mode and compete with other players on the leaderboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adapt your Strategy to your Enemies</h2>Some are simple brutes, some will try to pull you into the horde, and some will create more enemies upon death. Know your enemies and then prioritize your targets to ensure your survival. Build defenses that are best suited to eliminate swarming enemies.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/e1fc473d95deccf96cab560cb9a23803.avif?t=1677256883\" /></div><br><br><strong>LineHold</strong> online CO-OP Twin Stick Shooter mixed with Tower Defense. Survive as long as you can and expand your base as much as you can before next waves comes. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/c6ccd230694aa82c5c09e66ee167c6d7.poster.avif?t=1677256883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/c6ccd230694aa82c5c09e66ee167c6d7.webm?t=1677256883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/c6ccd230694aa82c5c09e66ee167c6d7.mp4?t=1677256883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tower Defense + Base Building</h2>Create your base filled with different turrets and buildings such as cloning unit, radar and many others. Additionally use indestructible nodes that you can use to build intricate maze for your enemies and block off strategic paths. Your planning and foresight will help you live longer.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/8adba68d95e5164ba866230388b23372.poster.avif?t=1677256883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/8adba68d95e5164ba866230388b23372.webm?t=1677256883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/8adba68d95e5164ba866230388b23372.mp4?t=1677256883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character Progression</h2>Choose your speciality and adjust unlocked skills to your gameplay! You decide what your character will be better at by choosing new skills and perks. And with each level you unlock more weapons and structures.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537590/extras/c86bc79c859772af785dd12853bd1fbb.avif?t=1677256883\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vast Arsenal</h2> Fight waves of enemies swarming your base using 10 different weapons - each of them has two firing modes. Use them to create combo effects for maximum damage. Keep shooting as your second weapon is reloading in the meantime - NON STOP ACTION!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Campaign Mode and Survival Mode</h2>Progress through more and more challenging missions in campaign or try to survive as long as possible in survival mode and compete with other players on the leaderboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adapt your Strategy to your Enemies</h2>Some are simple brutes, some will try to pull you into the horde, and some will create more enemies upon death. Know your enemies and then prioritize your targets to ensure your survival. Build defenses that are best suited to eliminate swarming enemies.",
    "short_description": "Online Co-op Twin Stick Shooter meets Tower Defense. Build up your defenses and balance your economy. Choose character class and level up - unlock new perks and active skills which will match your playstyle. Hold the Line for as long as you can!",
